# Cloudflare Pages response headers.
#
# HSTS is here because GitHub Pages could not send it - the reason the site moved to Cloudflare
# (2026-11-03). Six months, as ailiste.app; no includeSubDomains or preload until every subdomain
# is known to stay on HTTPS. The `!` line removes the wildcard CORS header Pages adds by itself.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=15552000
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
  ! Access-Control-Allow-Origin

# Astro's hashed assets: a changed file is a new URL, so the old one can be kept for a year.
/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
